# Summary

The statute provides that "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute." [[cite:obs-398eddd7a0a03ac7389639600a5e2ea07f608dcb "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]

The schedule specifies retention for ledgers as "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards." [[cite:obs-c7f9d2cb724d2860c4a2ef4fb33eaa34b8567c13 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]]